# Top-level build artefacts (Cargo + web). The `**/target/` glob is
# critical: a workspace-member or claude-worktree `target/` deeper in
# the tree would otherwise pour 5+ GB into the build context (C36.5
# lesson).
target/
**/target/
dist/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/.sqlx/

test_data/
examples/
.git/
node_modules/
e2e/
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.js.map

# Local dev workspaces / IDE / env state that bloat the build context.
.claude/
.github/
.gitea/
.devcontainer/
.codex-*.log
*.log
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*secret*
*secrets*
*credential*
*credentials*

# Files dockerignore'd to avoid invalidating image layer caches.
.dockerignore
docker-bake.hcl
docker-compose*.yaml
